Package: lua-bitop
Version: @DEB_LUA-BITOP_V@
Architecture: @DEB_ARCH@
Maintainer: @DEB_MAINTAINER@
Depends: liblua5.1-0, liblua5.2-0, libluajit-5.1-2
Section: Lua 
Priority: optional
Description: Bitwise operations for Lua
 Lua BitOp provides bitwise operations on numbers for Lua 5.1 and 5.2.
 This package also includes a library built against LuaJIT.
